{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51803","headline":"题螺江庙 · 陈谊","name":"题螺江庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庙里杉松萧飒[风]（飒），庙前江水碧溶溶。\n凭栏不见当时事，落日远山千万重。\n（《诗薮杂编》四引《郡阁雅谈》）（〖1〗见《增修诗话总龟》卷十六引《郡阁雅谈》、《吟窗杂录》卷四九引《江表志》。\n据後书，陈谊应爲南唐时人。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈谊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51803.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51803","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}